<!--
    The Cloudflare mark on a circle, for the account header on the resources page.

    The squircle variant (ic_app_cloudflare) exists because a home-screen tile has to match the
    grid around it. Clipping that squircle to a circle does not give a circle: its sides are
    almost straight, so cropping the corners leaves a polygon. The tile is drawn as an actual
    circle here instead, and the mark itself is the same artwork.
-->
